[BOUNDARY]
λ = [] : cannot form λ1; direct from [L]^(L+1), e.g. L=2 gives 2
λ=[2], L=2: observed=2, s0([2])=2, formula=2
λ=[2], L=3: observed=3, s0([2])=2, formula=3
λ=[1,1], L=2: observed=3, formula(if in-hyp)=3
λ=[4], L=3 (L<λ1): observed=3, formula=3
